{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/u-HYEgwAnmpFZc1SssgnLQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:22.345393+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/u-HYEgwAnmpFZc1SssgnLQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>国家林业和草原局哈尔滨林业机械研究所</span></span></p><p><span><span>关于举办2025年“优秀大学生暑期夏令营”的通知</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/eBAwf3cZ8PxiaEapEQUBROXnweKqNTx5KkjLxsibV7MF1Vn5RTicRnlU4Gr7GxyJWSElXOmu5A3HRYxnVqOcDdDcA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/eBAwf3cZ8PxiaEapEQUBROXnweKqNTx5KL3licicby3OGp8OAoKvxz8QricU9x9VsPabUY0kRdbxuy0pOpEU9AuTsw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/eBAwf3cZ8PxiaEapEQUBROXnweKqNTx5K3aLA3ShR5ZgBDrVPI9ViarFlMOR136QicK7jibOEsyRW29lq6EpickiaADg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span><span>为全面增强全国优秀大学生对林草装备前沿技术与国家战略需求的深度理解，切实提升其投身林草装备科研攻关与产业创新的热情与使命感，同时增进对国家林业和草原局哈尔滨林业机械研究所（简称</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>哈尔滨林机所</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span><span>）的了解，哈尔滨林机所拟于</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>0</span></span></span><span><span><span>日举办为期</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>天的线上线下联动式“全国优秀大学生林草装备暑期夏令营”。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>一、哈尔滨林机所简介</span></span></p><p><span><span>国家林业和草原局哈尔滨林业机械研究所是我国唯一的专业从事林草装备研发和寒温带林业研究工作的国家级领军科研机构，为中国林业科学研究院直属的国家级社会公益型研究所。在林</span></span><span><span>草</span></span><span><span>技术装备研究领域：以研究与创新为核心，覆盖了种苗培育、森林造林抚育、木竹采运备料、森林病虫害防治、林草火灾防控、防沙治沙、经济林果、林下经济、草原保护修复装备等多个细分研究方向。在寒温带林业研究领域：聚焦于林木遗传育种、森林培育、森林生态和森林保护四个学科方向。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>哈尔滨林机所现有职工</span></span><span><span>93</span></span><span><span>人，其中专业技术人员</span></span><span><span>65</span></span><span><span>人，高级职称</span></span><span><span>31</span></span><span><span>人，拥有一批林草装备领域国家及省部级科技人才，获得国家万人计划科技创新领军人才</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>人、中国青年科技奖</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>人、国家林业和草原局百千万人才工程省部级人选</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>人、国家林业和草原科技创新青年拔尖人才</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>人、中国林业科学研究院青年领军人才</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>人、哈尔滨市有突出贡献中青年专家</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>人、中国林科院杰出青年</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>人。作为中国林科院林业装备与信息化学科依托单位，获批林业工程一级学科下林业装备与信息化二级学科博士、博士后培养点。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>二、拟定活动安排</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>院所概览与研究生培养解读</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>科研团队专题分享</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>实验室、展室参观</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>营员个人风采展示</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>互动交流</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>三、申请条件</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请夏令营的同学须同时具备以下条件：</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，政治立场坚定，遵纪守法，品行端正，诚实守信，身心健康。</span></span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>全国高等院校、科研院所</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年应届毕业生（本科及硕士研究生）；在校学习成绩优秀，综合成绩排名在本专业前</span></span><span><span>30%</span></span><span><span>的优先。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>品学兼优，英语水平较好，无补考或重修记录，未受过纪律处分；英语四级成绩在</span></span><span><span>425</span></span><span><span>分以上，通过英语六级者优先。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>具有浓厚的科研兴趣，较强的创新意识和创新能力，有志于从事林草科学研究。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检标准，心理健康状况良好。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>四、申请材料</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>《哈林机所</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年大学生暑期夏令营活动申请表》（见附件）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>申请人个人简历</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>份；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>本科生提供大学期间前六学期成绩单和专业排名，硕士生提供硕士期间成绩单（需加盖教务处</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>系公章，如因不方便盖章须先提供成绩及排名，待开学后补交加盖公章的证明材料）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>英语水平证明（如四</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>六级、雅思、</span></span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span><span><span>或</span></span><span><span>GRE/GMAT</span></span><span><span>等）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>个人身份证明材料（包括身份证正</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>反面、学生证里</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>外面）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6.</span></span><span><span>其他证明材料（能证明个人学术水平的有代表性的学术论文首页及各类获奖证书等）。按照申请表、个人简历、成绩单、英语水平证明、个人身份证明材料、其他证明材料的顺序进行排列，整理成一个</span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span>文件（首页附材料清单）。文件命名规则：</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>夏令营申请</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>学校名称。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>五、报名时间及方式</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>本次拟招收营员不超过</span></span><span><span>30</span></span><span><span>名，即日起至</span></span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>日报名，将报名材料发至联系邮箱</span></span><span><span>linji1966@163.com.cn</span></span><span><span>，邮件名称：</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>夏令营申请</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>学校名称。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>六、入营名单</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>哈林机所将</span></span><span><span>于8</span></span><span><span>月6</span></span><span><span>日前</span></span><span><span>完成入营资格审核，以电子邮件或电话形式通知入营人员，并将入营名单在所网站公布，未入营者不再另行通知。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>七、注意事项</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>申请材料要确保真实可靠，资格审查不合格或弄虚作假者将立即取消营员资格。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>参加人员应遵守夏令营的安排和要求，按时参加各项活动。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>夏令营具体活动安排另行通知。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>八、联系方式</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span><span><span>0451-86663021</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span><span><span>linji1966@163.com.cn</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>地址：哈尔滨市南岗区学府路</span></span><span><span>374</span></span><span><span>号</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>九、附件</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>附件</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>：</span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/u-HYEgwAnmpFZc1SssgnLQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">申请表.docx</a></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"qrcode_for_gh_a145807126ad_258.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/eBAwf3cZ8PxiaEapEQUBROXnweKqNTx5KMSB6TPSwpLKAVZrskYe9TzJg3SQvXE0UYlae70VyzZyTxPE55wd3Mg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" title=\"qrcode_for_gh_a145807126ad_258.jpg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span>扫描二维码</span><span><br/></span><span>关注我们</span><span><br/></span><span>了解更多信息</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"7c71edee18b78fc94fe514f46611d8f225a472f2c6be0bb27f977cef33b62926","textLength":1620,"sourceSha256":"74435be8c5c70077550e560da3c28e01704a8feab25c84743c17af8586bb72c1","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9419366c97192e1ca19c","title":"2025年中国林业科学研究院国家林业和草原局哈尔滨林业机械研究所关于举办2025年“优秀大学生暑期夏令营”的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:22.345393+00:00"}
